  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7b59aca2b9aa96b4694ef68a6119afa9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial Case File
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _name: Tutorial
  Speaker: Tutorial
  lines:
  - With the information you now have, help the police by closing the case.
  - Pressing R will open the case file, here you can accuse me of drinking.
  - With the case file open, select on my profile and click on motive, means, and
    opportunity.
  - In the motive, means, and opportunity selection, use the bottle evidence you
    found.
  - Then finally, accuse me of being guilty.
  - If there are multiple profiles to select, you have to accuse someone of being
    guilty, and for the rest you should select not guilty.
  voiceLines: []
  choices: []
  isExit: 1
  evidence: {fileID: 0}
